      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> The document exchange stores both public information and private service settings. Check whether each file's access matches its purpose.",
      "taskInstructions": "Read <link=\"u04_file_permissions\"><u>file permissions</u></link>, then run <b>permcheck northbridge-docs</b> in the terminal. Compare the file purposes with the owner, group, and other permissions.",
      "taskQuestion": "Which file lets accounts outside its owner and group read private service settings?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> Correct. The final r-- in web.config grants read access to other accounts. That conflicts with its private purpose; the public notice is intended to be readable.",
